    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1dd9a5d4d09277637dbb",
      "document_start": 104,
      "document_end": 146,
      "text": "微分-代数方程的求解，无论是缩并法还是增广法，最终都归结为常微分方程初值问题的求解。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cb614b16a64577a80600",
      "document_start": 146,
      "document_end": 235,
      "text": "在可以用常微分方程描述的许多物理、力学过程中，常常包含许多复杂的子过程及它们之间的相互作用，其中有的子过程表现为快变化，另一些相对来说是慢变化，并且变化速度可以相差非常大的量级。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e4e0311adaf8c700860b",
      "document_start": 235,
      "document_end": 267,
      "text": "相应地，描述这些过程的常微分方程的解中也包含快变分量和慢变分量。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3c8d29056b995ee987e6",
      "document_start": 267,
      "document_end": 292,
      "text": "如果在一个过程中，快、慢子过程变化的速度差别达到一",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5ba1d11910823ea7aa94",
      "document_start": 294,
      "document_end": 314,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_81bc97f455b154d87082",
      "document_start": 315,
      "document_end": 319,
      "text": "# 1.",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_600054cd1bd71e48c469",
      "document_start": 320,
      "document_end": 325,
      "text": "刚性问题;",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_26c023410cea67e7b982",
      "document_start": 326,
      "document_end": 358,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4ed17efc82fd7792af34",
      "document_start": 360,
      "document_end": 404,
      "text": "定量级，在数学上称这种系统具有刚性性质，描述这类变化过程的常微分方程系统则称为刚性系统。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2174ff22cd0341155d0a",
      "document_start": 404,
      "document_end": 422,
      "text": "刚性方程也称为病态方程或坏条件方程。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9a461ca429e7adb83180",
      "document_start": 422,
      "document_end": 459,
      "text": "刚性问题存在于多刚体系统动力学的某些情形，更普遍存在于多柔体系统动力学中。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b24d9b23b63d03123330",
      "document_start": 459,
      "document_end": 532,
      "text": "比如在多刚体系统运动过程中，可能会由于系统中构件之间的差异过大，导致系统中构件运动速度差别很大，从而使描述系统运动的微分-代数方程呈现出刚性特征。",
      "section_id": "section_4e839846da57"
    }
